<title>USA: NACCO Industries Inc sets qtly divs $0.1875.</title>
<headline>NACCO Industries Inc sets qtly divs $0.1875.</headline>
<dateline>MAYFIELD HEIGHTS, Ohio 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>NACCO Industries said it declared quarterly dividend on both its class A and class B common stock of $0.1875 per share.</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		$0.1875		   $0.1875</p>
<p> Pay		  March 14</p>
<p> Record		March 3</p>
